{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"8c207a15-4784-49be-a3df-76e8dcf39f28","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have Q5.5:\n\n**Q5.5**: 有哪些硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具可以用于评估 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载下多算子/微算子并发的硬件设计？这些工具如何建模计算单元、访存层次、互联和功耗/面积？关键评估指标是什么？\n\n**预关键词**: gem5, GPGPU-Sim, Accel-Sim, SST, SystemC TLM, Verilator, Icarus Verilog, Vivado Simulator, ModelSim/QuestaSim, McPAT, CACTI, DRAMSim2/DRAMSim3, BookSim, Garnet, Orion, GPUWattch, Scale-Sim, MAESTRO, Timeloop, ZigZag, Accelergy, FireSim, performance counter, roofline model, throughput, latency, energy efficiency, TOPS/W, area efficiency, bandwidth utilization, compute utilization, MoE expert load imbalance, DiT diffusion step latency, multimodal encoder-decoder pipeline stall, video frame throughput, power envelope\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Semantic decomposition of Q5.5 into logical chain nodes\n2. Search vault across 4 directories for each node\n3. Read notes\n4. Write answer\n\nLet me decompose Q5.5:\n\n**Q5.5 Text**: \"有哪些硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具可以用于评估 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载下多算子/微算子并发的硬件设计？这些工具如何建模计算单元、访存层次、互联和功耗/面积？关键评估指标是什么？\"\n\nLogical decomposition:\n\n**S1**: \"硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具\" — 工具/平台识别（核心机制）\n- Core concepts: gem5, GPGPU-Sim, Accel-Sim, SST, FireSim, Verilator, SystemC TLM\n- Role: 工具/平台类别\n\n**S2**: \"MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载\" — 模型负载特性（对象/模型负载）\n- Core concepts: MoE expert, DiT diffusion, multimodal, video\n- Role: 目标负载\n\n**S3**: \"多算子/微算子并发\" — 并发场景（计算场景）\n- Core concepts: multi-operator concurrency, micro-operator concurrency\n- Role: 计算场景约束\n\n**S4**: \"如何建模计算单元\" — 计算单元建模方法（核心机制）\n- Core concepts: PE array modeling, Tensor Core modeling, systolic array, compute unit\n- Role: 计算建模\n\n**S5**: \"如何建模访存层次\" — 访存层次建模方法（核心机制）\n- Core concepts: memory hierarchy modeling, HBM, cache, shared memory, CACTI, DRAMSim\n- Role: 访存建模\n\n**S6**: \"如何建模互联\" — 互联建模方法（核心机制）\n- Core concepts: NoC modeling, BookSim, Garnet, Orion, interconnect\n- Role: 互联建模\n\n**S7*