{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"8c207a15-4784-49be-a3df-76e8dcf39f28","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，我已经读取了 Q5.5 的问题文本和预关键词。现在开始执行 Answer Agent 流程。\n\n## Step 1: 语义分割\n\n### 1.1 & 1.2 逻辑链条拆分\n\n**Q5.5**: 有哪些硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具可以用于评估 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载下多算子/微算子并发的硬件设计？这些工具如何建模计算单元、访存层次、互联和功耗/面积？关键评估指标是什么？\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 | 长匹配 Query (Level A) |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|------------------------|\n| **S1** | 硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具 | 核心机制：工具识别 | gem5, GPGPU-Sim, Accel-Sim, FireSim, Verilator, SystemC TLM, SST | `\"architecture simulator\" gem5 GPGPU-Sim` |\n| **S2** | MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载 | 对象/模型负载 | MoE, DiT, multimodal, video | `MoE DiT \"multimodal\" video hardware accelerator` |\n| **S3** | 多算子/微算子并发 | 计算场景 | multi-operator concurrency, micro-operator, concurrent execution | `\"multi-operator\" \"micro-operator\" concurrency accelerator` |\n| **S4** | 如何建模计算单元 | 核心机制：计算建模 | PE array, Tensor Core, systolic array, compute unit modeling | `\"compute unit\" modeling \"PE array\" \"Tensor Core\"` |\n| **S5** | 如何建模访存层次 | 核心机制：访存建模 | memory hierarchy, HBM, cache, shared memory, CACTI, DRAMSim | `\"memory hierarchy\" modeling HBM cache CACTI` |\n| **S6** | 如何建模互联 | 核心机制：互联建模 | NoC, BookSim, Garnet, interconnect modeling | `NoC \"interconnect\" modeling BookSim Garnet` |\n| **S7** | 如何建模功耗/面积 | 约束/指标：功耗面积 | McPAT, GPUWattch, Accelergy, power/area modeling | `McPAT GPUWattch Accelergy \"power area\" modeling` |\n| **S8** | 关键评估指标 | 指标：评估体系 | throughput, latency, TOPS/W, bandwidth utilization, roofline model | `throughput latency TOPS energy efficiency \"roofline model\"` |\n\n现在开始 Step 1.3 四目录并行搜索。我将按 Level A→B→C 的阶梯对每个节点在四个目录中搜索。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21239,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3a8c